    # Calculate the dot product of (u + v) and (2u - v)
    # u + v = (u1 + v1, u2 + v2)
    # 2u - v = (2u1 - v1, 2u2 - v2)
    # Using the properties of dot product:
    # (u + v) · (2u - v) = u · (2u - v) + v · (2u - v)
