\[
\psi(3^n) = c^{3^n} - 3c^{3^{n-1}}.
\]

#### Step 3: General Form for \(\psi(3^n)\)

From the recursive relationship, we can derive:
\[
\psi(3^n) = c^{3^n} - 3c^{3^{n-1}}.
