   where \( b_{DF} \) is the y-intercept calculated as:
   \[
   b_{DF} = y_D - m_{DF} \cdot x_D
   \]

3. **Find the slope of the perpendicular line \( EM \)**:
   The slope of the line perpendicular to \( DF \) is the negative reciprocal of \( m_{DF} \):
   \[
