### Step 2: Identifying Invertible Integers

We will check each integer \( i \) from \( 0 \) to \( 15 \) to see if \( \gcd(i, 16) = 1 \):

- \( \gcd(0, 16) = 16 \) (non-invertible)
- \( \gcd(1, 16) = 1 \) (invertible)
- \( \gcd(2, 16) = 2 \) (non-invertible)
- \( \gcd(3, 16) = 1 \) (invertible)
- \( \gcd(4, 16) = 4 \) (non-invertible)
