   \]

3. **Total Days from 2008 to 2016**:
   The total number of years from 2008 to 2016 is:
   \[
   2016 - 2008 + 1 = 9 \text{ years}
   \]
   Thus, the total number of cake-eating days over these years is:
   \[
   \text{Total Days} = 39 \text{ days/year} \times 9 \text{ years} = 351 \text{ days}
   \]

### Code Output Interpretation
