   - Then \( x = 3m = 36 \).
   - We need \( n \) such that \( y = 3n < 100 \) and \( \text{gcd}(12, n) = 1 \).
   - The possible values for \( n \) that are coprime to \( 12 \) are \( 1, 5, 7, 11 \).
